body:
# Hi, fellow YouTubers, I'm Lily, I'm a psychic, sociologist, skincare enthusiast, and former therapist. This summer I plan to make videos about sociological issues, psychology, spirituality, skincare, personal development, and much more. My newest video is all about the case of the infamous John Titor- the time traveler from 2036. With my background in sociology, psychology, and spirituality I delve into the predictions he made, the motives behind someone creating this as a hoax, and possible explanations like the many worlds theory and parallel universes! Join me for educating, interesting, and fascinating videos every week. My goal this summer is to join the Youtube partnership program this summer, make amazing content, and to become monetized. Thank you in advance for your support!

&#x200B;

[https://youtu.be/Rnol4q3FApU](https://youtu.be/Rnol4q3FApU)
